In map, image of Vietnam is drawn reduced according to scale 1 : 10,000,000.

6
00:01:08,590 --> 00:01:31,060
Meaning: Length 1 cm on map corresponds to actual length 10,000,000 cm or 100 km.

7
00:01:34,180 --> 00:01:43,210
Map scale can be written as a fraction with numerator one.

8
00:01:45,880 --> 00:01:57,060
Example: one thousandth, one five hundredth, one millionth,…

